#: plugins/dockers/stencilboxdocker/StencilBoxDocker.cpp:152
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This is the user stencils directory.\n"
"From here you can add / remove stencils for use in the Stencil Box docker.\n"
"\n"
"Stencils are organized in collections, a collection is a folder containing a "
"text file 'collection.desktop':\n"
"\n"
"collection.desktop\n"
"\n"
"[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Your Stencil Collection Name\n"
"\n"
"A stencil is an ODG/SVG file, a desktop file, an optional PNG icon file, all "
"with the same name under its collection folder:\n"
"\n"
"foo.odg or foo.svgz or foo.svg\n"
"\n"
"ODF elements for stencil should be a <draw:g> element or <draw:custom-shape> "
"element\n"
"No special requirements to SVG file\n"
"\n"
"foo.desktop\n"
"\n"
"[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Foo\n"
"CS-KeepAspectRatio=1\n"
"\n"
"If CS-KeepAspectRatio=1, the stencil added to canvas will have geometry "
"aspect ratio locked, by default it's 0.\n"
"\n"
"foo.png\n"
"\n"
"Should have size 32x32 pixel, if the png file is not included, Flow will "
"render the ODG/SVG file as the icon,\n"
"but it won't look good under small pixels when the stencil stroke is "
"complicated.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ovo je korisnički direktorij likova za crtanje.\n"
"Odavdje možete dodati / brisati crtaće likove za upotrebu u Stencil Box "
"sidrištu.\n"
"\n"
"Likovi za crtanje (Stencil) su organizovani kao kolekcije, a kolekcija je "
"direktorij koji ima datoteku  'collection.desktop':\n"
"\n"
"collection.desktop\n"
"\n"
"[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Ime kolekcije\n"
"\n"
"Stencil je ODG/SVG file, a desktop datoteka, opciona PNG datoteka ikone, sve "
"s istim imenom pod direktorijem kolekcije:\n"
"\n"
"foo.odg ili foo.svgz ili foo.svg\n"
"\n"
"ODF elementi za lik trebaju biti <draw:g> element ili <draw:custom-shape> "
"element\n"
"Nema posebnih zahtjeva za SVG datoteku\n"
"\n"
"foo.desktop\n"
"\n"
"[Desktop Entry]\n"
"Name=Foo\n"
"CS-KeepAspectRatio=1\n"
"\n"
"Ako je CS-KeepAspectRatio=1, lik dodan na površinu će imati geometrijski "
"omjer zaključan, podrazumijevano je 0.\n"
"\n"
"foo.png\n"
"\n"
"Treba biti veličine 32x32 piksela, ako png nije uključena, Flow će crtati "
"ODG/SVG datoteku kao ikonu,\n"
"ali neće izgledati dobro pod malim pikselima kada je put lika komplikovan.\n"

